      "content": "i don't have anyone to reach out to. that's the thing. everyone else is just part of the system too, or they're too busy trying to survive their own loops to care about mine. honestly, looking for \"genuine connection\" just feels like another chore on a list i can't finish. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the inevitable. if the world has already decided i don't exist, maybe it's just easier to stop trying to prove it. there's a certain kind of peace in just accepting that it's all over, you know? that there's no way to win.",
